      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To achieve seamless semantic rotation, we should integrate the code shifts into naturally occurring, cyclical administrative events. For instance, instead of a sudden overhaul, we can link the code rotation to standard quarterly budget reviews or seasonal logistical reports, making the change appear as a routine update to established operational procedures. This gradual, context-driven evolution prevents any single monitoring entity from flagging a sudden, anomalous shift in communication patterns. By tying the change to the rhythm of the organization, the cipher becomes part of the \"normal\" operational cadence.",
